    {
      "paragraphId": "P00065",
      "path": "tabs.t.p2fbha52wxtn.body.content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.p2fbha52wxtn",
      "tabTitle": "deep research",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1,
      "endIndex": 150,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tshc5ku068jx",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "GLock addresses a validated gap: micro firms represent 90.66% of Philippine establishments, while retail and food service dominate the MSME economy.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00066",
      "path": "tabs.t.p2fbha52wxtn.body.content[2]",
      "tabId": "t.p2fbha52wxtn",
      "tabTitle": "deep research",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 150,
      "endIndex": 356,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tshc5ku068jx",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Digital payments are mainstream, but business operations lag: 72.2% of person-initiated payments were digital in 2024, compared with 19.8% of business-initiated payments and 13.7% of B2B supplier payments.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00067",
      "path": "tabs.t.p2fbha52wxtn.body.content[3]",
      "tabId": "t.p2fbha52wxtn",
      "tabTitle": "deep research",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 356,
      "endIndex": 501,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tshc5ku068jx",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The recommended positioning is a bounded Micro-ERP connecting money, inventory, obligations, and replenishment—not a simplified SAP replacement.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00068",
      "path": "tabs.t.p2fbha52wxtn.body.content[4]",
      "tabId": "t.p2fbha52wxtn",
      "tabTitle": "deep research",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 501,
      "endIndex": 751,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tshc5ku068jx",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The realistic FMCG integration path starts with distributors and retailer-approved reorder recommendations. Autonomous VMI should follow only after catalog mapping, acknowledgements, partial fulfillment, returns, and reservation controls are proven.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00069",
      "path": "tabs.t.p2fbha52wxtn.body.content[5]",
      "tabId": "t.p2fbha52wxtn",
      "tabTitle": "deep research",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 751,
      "endIndex": 932,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tshc5ku068jx",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The report includes evidence grading, the Capital Guard formula, ledger architecture, VMI maturity model, feature economics, privacy controls for GRadar, and a 90-day pilot design.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00070",
